The speaker model needs a one-time download with a Hugging Face account:
  1. Sign in at https://huggingface.co (create a free account if needed).
  2. Open https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1 , fill in the two
     required fields (Company/university, Use case) and click 'Agree and access repository'.
  3. At https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens create a token of type 'Read' and copy it.
  4. Paste it below (it won't show as you paste). Answer 'n' if asked about git credentials.

Press Enter when steps 1-3 are done...
